          "t": "2026-10-01T02:53:50.422241+00:00",
          "text": "Added as **section 0, The plan from here**, at the top. Short version: 1) you answer the inputs page (your taste matters most), 2) I do run 3 with all sources, giving 10 ideas, 3) you pick 5\u20137, 4) one-time setup, 5) a 2-day build sprint, 6) **start posting Monday, Oct 5** (today was the old start, and no builds exist yet), 7) make it the idea-bank skill, 8) Day 31 selling around Nov 4."
        }
      ],
      "addressed": true
    },
    {
